  "text": "The program has mobilized over 40 private-sector members and secured EUR 30 million in financing from BMZ, with up to USD 5 billion in risk capacity offered by IDF. A tailored parametric cyclone solution is under development, and a 2024 diagnostic has been published. Current insurance penetration in Bangladesh is 0.15%, with inclusive insurance coverage at 10%, indicating a significant protection gap.",
